From: Kuninori Morimoto <kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
Subject: [PATCH 023/159] ASoC: codec duplicated callback function goes to component on tfa9879
Date: Mon, 8 Aug 2016 08:54:44 +0000
Message-ID: <87zion7imc.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <87wpjr8xld.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
